sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Admin
    participant F as Dashboard (Frontend)
    participant B as Backend (Flask)
    participant D as SQLite DB
    participant BC as Blockchain (Ethereum)

    A->>F: Remplit le formulaire d'émission
    F->>B: POST /certificates {recipient_name, email, program, institution, issue_date}
    B->>B: Vérifie session + rôle admin

    alt Non autorisé
        B-->>F: 403 Forbidden
    else Autorisé
        B->>B: Génère ID (CERT-YYYY-XXXXX)
        B->>B: Calcule blockchain_hash (SHA-256)
        B->>BC: Enregistre hash sur Ethereum Testnet
        BC-->>B: tx_hash (transaction hash)
        B->>D: INSERT INTO certificates (...)
        B->>D: INSERT INTO audit_logs (action='ISSUE', ...)
        B-->>F: 201 Created {certificate}
        F->>A: Affiche confirmation + ID du certificat
    end
